   <text type="letter">
      <body>
         <div type="writingSession">
            <pb n="1"/>
            <opener><dateline><date when="1949-05-01">May 1st, 1949</date></dateline>
               <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Dr.
                  Tillich</rs>:</salute>
            </opener>
            <p>We are looking forward to seeing you next Friday <add place="left"><hi rend="hand"
                        ><date when="1949-05-01">Fri 6 May 1949</date></hi></add>. Your Friday
               lecture is supposed to start at 8.30, and the Saturday panel ends at noon.</p>
            <p>I enclose a time table. You have to take a train to <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__1752" type="place">Rhinecliff</rs>,
            the latest from <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New York</rs> is 6.10 Daylight
            Saving time (in the time table listed as 5.10), the same train leaves <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__946" type="place">Poughkeepsie</rs>
            at 7.50 and arrives at <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__1752" type="place">Rhinecliff</rs> at 8.07.
            A taxi will here wait for you and bring you directly to the place of your lecture.</p>
            <p>The first return train on Saturday is 2.56 from <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__1753" type="place">Barrytown</rs>, arriving at 5.37
            in <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New York</rs>.</p>
            <p>If you prefer to take other trains please let us know.</p><closer>
               <salute>Cordially yours,</salute>
               <signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__5379" type="person"
                  ><hi rend="hand">Werner Wolff</hi><lb/>Werner Wolff</rs></signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
